label story_03_complete (The Long Road Complete)
[style name="Gameplay"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): You reached the Ruins of Veld. I can feel their stones through your breath.
"Dianthus Core": Once, roots crossed there without fear. Now the cracks drink shadow and return only hunger.
"Dianthus Core": Take care among the broken walls. Shadow Resin gathers where old life was pressed too long beneath void.
"Dianthus Core": Bring back proof, and I will teach the garden how to answer ruin with craft.
